WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.733 --> 00:00:17.403
"Where's Mom?" Oliver asked.

2
00:00:17.404 --> 00:00:21.233
"Mom's working late," Harry said.

3
00:00:21.234 --> 00:00:26.988
"She's busy this week."

4
00:00:26.989 --> 00:00:30.693
"Let's help her!" Oliver said.

5
00:00:30.694 --> 00:00:34.178
"We can do the laundry," Emmy said.

6
00:00:34.179 --> 00:00:38.939
"That will be a nice surprise."

7
00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:43.518
The kids brought their dirty clothes to the laundry room.

8
00:00:43.519 --> 00:00:47.484
"Make two piles on the floor," Emmy said.

9
00:00:47.485 --> 00:00:52.774
"One for dark clothes and one for light clothes."

10
00:00:52.775 --> 00:00:56.960
Rover ran through both piles.

11
00:00:56.961 --> 00:01:01.677
"Dogs can't help with the laundry!" Harry said.

12
00:01:01.678 --> 00:01:05.820
He took Rover outside.

13
00:01:05.821 --> 00:01:09.714
Emmy put the dark clothes in the washer.

14
00:01:09.715 --> 00:01:13.688
She put in some soap too.

15
00:01:13.689 --> 00:01:19.187
Then Oliver pressed Start.

16
00:01:19.188 --> 00:01:23.783
After a while it was time to dry the clothes.

17
00:01:23.784 --> 00:01:28.178
Harry took the clothes from the washer.

18
00:01:28.179 --> 00:01:33.790
Oliver put them in the dryer.

19
00:01:33.791 --> 00:01:41.443
Emmy put the next load in the washer.

20
00:01:41.444 --> 00:01:46.184
At last all the laundry was done.

21
00:01:46.185 --> 00:01:50.239
"Now we fold our clothes," Emmy said.

22
00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:57.491
"And put everything away in our rooms."

23
00:01:57.492 --> 00:02:02.511
"Doing laundry is so much work!" Harry said.

24
00:02:02.512 --> 00:02:07.618
"I'm glad Mom does it for us," Oliver said.

25
00:02:07.619 --> 00:02:11.044
Mom came home from work.

26
00:02:11.045 --> 00:02:15.594
The kids showed her their clean clothes.

27
00:02:15.595 --> 00:02:19.663
"You did a wonderful job!" Mom said.

28
00:02:19.664 --> 00:02:23.569
She smiled happily.

29
00:02:23.570 --> 00:02:30.920
"Now you can do your laundry every week."

30
00:02:30.921 --> 00:02:36.650
The boys groaned.

31
00:02:36.651 --> 00:02:40.807
"We wanted to surprise Mom," Emmy said.

32
00:02:40.808 --> 00:02:47.144
"But she surprised us!"
